  "id": 109,
  "Specification": "A simulation module for the Knuth-Yao random number generation algorithm, specifically modeling 'crooked' (biased) coins. It integrates with TLC's side-effect operators to log transitions and outcomes to a CSV file, utilizes external R scripts for statistical analysis, and performs a Chi-square statistical test in its post-condition to verify probability distributions.",
